## Bundled Runtime Dependencies

The following packages are bundled directly into `out/extension.js` by esbuild
(`bundle: true`, `platform: 'node'`) and shipped inside the packaged `.vsix`.
`node_modules/` itself is excluded from the packaged extension (see
`.vscodeignore`), so these packages' own `LICENSE` files are not otherwise
preserved in the distributed artifact — listed here instead.

1. vscode-languageclient (https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node)
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
   License: MIT
   Used for: Language Server Protocol client implementation

2. vscode-jsonrpc (https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node)
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
   License: MIT
   Used for: Transitive dependency of vscode-languageclient (JSON-RPC transport)

3. vscode-languageserver-protocol (https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node)
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
   License: MIT
   Used for: Transitive dependency of vscode-languageclient (LSP message types)

4. vscode-languageserver-textdocument (https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node)
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
   License: MIT
   Used for: Transitive dependency of vscode-languageclient (text document model)

5. vscode-languageserver-types (https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node)
   Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
   License: MIT
   Used for: Transitive dependency of vscode-languageclient (shared LSP types)

